  <h1>All India Sufi & Bhakti Poetry Summit 2026 Announced for Hyderabad</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt; color: #475569; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 16px;">Over 80 scholars, poets, and musicians to gather at Golconda Fort for three days of mystic communion.</p>
  
