  <h2>Article Content</h2>
  <div class="article-content">
    <h2>The Confluence of Mystic Voices</h2><p>HYDERABAD — The historic ramparts of Golconda Fort will echo with the ecstatic couplets of Kabir, Bulleh Shah, Mirabai, and Amir Khusrau this autumn.</p>
